  "summary": "Picks the strongest unit among the caster's nearest allies and buffs it: attack by 1/2/3/6 and AP by 10/20/30/60 (by caster stars, scaled by the caster's AP). Depending on the caster's name, one extra effect is applied to the same ally: Vanilla +80 shield, Ruby +30 speed, Matcha +60 max HP, Mint heal 40 and +15 special defense, Lemon +40 crit chance, Salted heal 40 and +15 defense, Ruby Swirl +10 attack, Caramel Swirl +80 crit power, Rainbow Swirl +50 PP. Milcery has no extra effect. Does nothing if no ally exists.",
  "targeting": {
   "who": "among all allies other than the caster, those at the smallest Chebyshev distance (ties all kept); among them the one with the highest score = 100 x held items + 10 x stars + sell price, random among equal best scores",
   "needsTarget": false,
   "note": "requiresTarget is false so the caster does not walk to a target. The caster itself is never buffed. getStrongestUnit picks randomly on ties, so the receiver is not deterministic in tied cases. Whether board.forEach includes dead entities was not read.",
   "evidence": [
    "dc-select",
    "nearest",
    "distance",
    "strongest"
   ]
  },
